    {
      "id": "u_63bc46467e0bf8ffb2f7405e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The attributes tab provides a more graphical way to view and edit __TRILIUM_PH_0__attributes__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "63bc46467e0bf8ffb2f7405eded7125cadfa7d1c721658fdfa093e0b1b5245c6",
      "context": "Attributes tab",
      "contextHash": "3182d6d53678eff39c22a63584e1af2aa0433ebed474ee2466c154f4e55b26be",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_01af600ae6b2e9371057cc08_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Sections__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "01af600ae6b2e9371057cc085adf9aeb17d15db349731d9587c078a856763cd0",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Sections",
      "contextHash": "e5dc8f73269dbfae8f0d84b9faea5515191c148daac5c42c90d7d144698525ac",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4e9eca6b685ad984ad3f93e9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The attributes are grouped into collapsible sections, each showing the number of attributes it holds next to its name:",
      "sourceHash": "4e9eca6b685ad984ad3f93e96a6f5a7ef103acee5cbdb5ab8eb04b4af0ae7d7b",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Sections",
      "contextHash": "e5dc8f73269dbfae8f0d84b9faea5515191c148daac5c42c90d7d144698525ac",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_32c0f1590d21732a97c0ebd4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Owned__TRILIUM_PH_1__ contains a list of the attributes that belong to this note.",
      "sourceHash": "32c0f1590d21732a97c0ebd4233a8f8068f9b468975b0293c4c99d9d17e40d22",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Sections",
      "contextHash": "e5dc8f73269dbfae8f0d84b9faea5515191c148daac5c42c90d7d144698525ac",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b102ded94e5642d5ff7bc0ca_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Inherited__TRILIUM_PH_1__ contains the attributes that apply to the current note but come through __TRILIUM_PH_2__Attribute Inheritance__TRILIUM_PH_3__. This section is only displayed if the note inherits attributes.",
      "sourceHash": "b102ded94e5642d5ff7bc0ca30601f9a33be03fdef4ef122c8f4e753aba438f7",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Sections",
      "contextHash": "e5dc8f73269dbfae8f0d84b9faea5515191c148daac5c42c90d7d144698525ac",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8274b16fde2ab9273b7f1682_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Definitions__TRILIUM_PH_1__ describe the type of attributes and are used in __TRILIUM_PH_2__Promoted Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and __TRILIUM_PH_4__Table__TRILIUM_PH_5__ collections. This section is only displayed if the note has or inherits definitions.",
      "sourceHash": "8274b16fde2ab9273b7f16824d62fe003e649c7be6415ba363cf63ede0b461b3",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Sections",
      "contextHash": "e5dc8f73269dbfae8f0d84b9faea5515191c148daac5c42c90d7d144698525ac",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c96a8cbe1ea39a55df7fd02e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Clicking the name of a section collapses or expands it, and the collapsed state is remembered.",
      "sourceHash": "c96a8cbe1ea39a55df7fd02e98a1e3eaca1fdf7f38e83467c0739590e61c04ab",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Sections",
      "contextHash": "e5dc8f73269dbfae8f0d84b9faea5515191c148daac5c42c90d7d144698525ac",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_01c444f7b63488910ae398a2_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "01c444f7b63488910ae398a207ae7d9de5dfa4cb15f7a416ca85756611ef8dbc",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Toolbar",
      "contextHash": "c54b7452151d58298dd5dbf34060846e4424f1d212699907d0bf3d3739361df9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_651f550c2d484824ea7dfc03_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Above the sections there is a toolbar with:",
      "sourceHash": "651f550c2d484824ea7dfc03ec4de39fde227216739c8926b7abb8d5ccd1f96a",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Toolbar",
      "contextHash": "c54b7452151d58298dd5dbf34060846e4424f1d212699907d0bf3d3739361df9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b38e86912277477942a73745_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A __TRILIUM_PH_0__Select all__TRILIUM_PH_1__ checkbox, which selects every attribute (see __TRILIUM_PH_2__Selecting attributes__TRILIUM_PH_3__).",
      "sourceHash": "b38e86912277477942a73745c12c0469ef06e9b22dc4e0d808040e901367b231",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Toolbar",
      "contextHash": "c54b7452151d58298dd5dbf34060846e4424f1d212699907d0bf3d3739361df9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3a71c5ba27b063d4a368ae29_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button, which only appears after attributes are copied. It lists the copied attributes and offers to paste them into the current note or to clear them.",
      "sourceHash": "3a71c5ba27b063d4a368ae29d5e93104c77edd8bf183d0cf6f74777cc548038e",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Toolbar",
      "contextHash": "c54b7452151d58298dd5dbf34060846e4424f1d212699907d0bf3d3739361df9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3cfd4d4f87bc489d9840dc31_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Add a new attribute__TRILIUM_PH_2__ button, which offers to add a label, a relation, a label definition or a relation definition. This shows the full detail popup.",
      "sourceHash": "3cfd4d4f87bc489d9840dc3101b84094ef988b3b6a7ccc27ef00f57acdab3433",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Toolbar",
      "contextHash": "c54b7452151d58298dd5dbf34060846e4424f1d212699907d0bf3d3739361df9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c2f0741a4ac49ba30859e311_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On a note that cannot be edited (such as a page of the in-app help), the paste and add buttons are replaced by a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Read-only__TRILIUM_PH_2__ indicator. Attributes can still be selected and copied from such a note.",
      "sourceHash": "c2f0741a4ac49ba30859e311fe5ae9f9c184bb2c6ceaa6fe7f7fb005898c310b",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Toolbar",
      "contextHash": "c54b7452151d58298dd5dbf34060846e4424f1d212699907d0bf3d3739361df9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_948e77d8825dd899fd9d2a75_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Owned attributes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "948e77d8825dd899fd9d2a75a608f5b8be400ad940174d655ec84d36afb25bc5",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d6cbe91a7b44e31731ed86fe_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Every item is structured as such:",
      "sourceHash": "d6cbe91a7b44e31731ed86fe3bfc0426f65ba6fa8542256f64d3baa48194cf3a",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ecf18c17897bc60c6b3d9f1e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The icon of each item indicates whether it's a __TRILIUM_PH_0__label__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__) or a __TRILIUM_PH_3__relation__TRILIUM_PH_4__ (__TRILIUM_PH_5__, link to another note).",
      "sourceHash": "ecf18c17897bc60c6b3d9f1e0688614f9251beb20a132a56ff05e86da83e84a9",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_52315247b77dcdfbd0ac7186_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The first text is the name of the label.",
      "sourceHash": "52315247b77dcdfbd0ac71865d0006a8d66a5fbc3fb13e18dcc565c2e2f58fd8",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c1c23af187fb7399f7584188_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The value of the attribute is displayed after the name, if present.",
      "sourceHash": "c1c23af187fb7399f7584188a56c1652c20bc49c460ce1d3219acdf19ff80f9d",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_beec026675b2dd4905d92919_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The value is shown in a graphical way: a relation's value is a clickable note link; a color label shows a color chip.",
      "sourceHash": "beec026675b2dd4905d92919cb318aa8900191ee551794476ff446139e08a06f",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_36c82d4b508f351c9e824b89_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "System attributes (that have a special meaning in Trilium) show a small __TRILIUM_PH_0__ cog near the icon and are grouped separately from the user-defined ones.",
      "sourceHash": "36c82d4b508f351c9e824b89889ba5f6df4c63c044f9417566c798c9faa39846",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fc4ae0b3d4843566243c61a7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Interaction:",
      "sourceHash": "fc4ae0b3d4843566243c61a706f07f3ad62a47bb4d3d2cc9caf2ef792bf1ba67",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ec5b4a3c852c811123568517_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking on the item (apart from the value and links) reveals a dedicated popup where the name, value and __TRILIUM_PH_0__Attribute Inheritance__TRILIUM_PH_1__ can be defined.",
      "sourceHash": "ec5b4a3c852c811123568517413897efcd501e21a04106428e0c0888f867cda7",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_484e34237104879b8d529efb_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The value of the attributes can be edited in-place:",
      "sourceHash": "484e34237104879b8d529efb24222b1961fa149a76473304cfe4b101b2b5fa50",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_254df72d04d71d77fdf9e2cb_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The input box follows the type defined in a corresponding label definition (date, color, dropdown, numbers), as well as for system attributes that have a specific type (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_0__).",
      "sourceHash": "254df72d04d71d77fdf9e2cb5cd31f8bc32f2c97a197e684d75650df7ddae92f",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_36d3fd9d8ce2d72584977a63_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For labels, clicking on the value edits its in-place.",
      "sourceHash": "36d3fd9d8ce2d72584977a639dfd80c44d3527c34b617a2f2e130a54122ebf4d",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6cf014e8b1ba623e20756015_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to confirm or click outside the input box, or __TRILIUM_PH_2__Esc__TRILIUM_PH_3__ to dismiss.",
      "sourceHash": "6cf014e8b1ba623e2075601550d3266bd896a73fe090265a13cc0bedf98da964",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_63b74dd127dac39b97ea0ca2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For multi-line text, __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_3__ confirms whereas __TRILIUM_PH_4__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_5__ creates a newline.",
      "sourceHash": "63b74dd127dac39b97ea0ca262da2ee1dd89e2c1b564881775ee9cb86b9308b8",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_faecb96b0e56231b98204eee_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For checkbox attributes, clicking on the checkbox will toggle its state.",
      "sourceHash": "faecb96b0e56231b98204eeeb3600e397047eea8db7992ab74ee3d9bbba14eea",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_12d5cc0f006068c7fe1decd3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For labels without a value, a value can be added by clicking on the __TRILIUM_PH_0__No value__TRILIUM_PH_1__ text which appears while the mouse is hovered on the item.",
      "sourceHash": "12d5cc0f006068c7fe1decd3703c40dbd3218f7fabe7534f58ae33c892252818",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_273d4f7ff9bd608f0e50cb10_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For relations, there is a dedicated __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button instead.",
      "sourceHash": "273d4f7ff9bd608f0e50cb10576abe4afa26fbbc67dac620149e947d6fab2b7a",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8f2c32ff5a7ae653d9dcef68_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "An attribute can be deleted by pressing the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button to its right, which only appears while hovered. A confirmation screen is displayed first to ensure the attribute is not accidentally deleted.",
      "sourceHash": "8f2c32ff5a7ae653d9dcef6874a27ec011b13f83a1e17dba11f672fd826f730c",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d3ae977054bd105337c9711_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Attributes can be added in two ways:",
      "sourceHash": "2d3ae977054bd105337c9711b059e754bdeb418b20795d4f91f4e59d84decf9e",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0bb7471d69a389fdce66431d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A new label, relation or attribute definition can be added from the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button in the __TRILIUM_PH_1__toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_2__. This shows the full detail popup.",
      "sourceHash": "0bb7471d69a389fdce66431da9431f29862c4edea9c58116102f5b85d3a128dd",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_14093b9154b53561ad795d1a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To quickly add a label or a relation directly from the sidebar, click the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Add attribute__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__) item at the end of the list.",
      "sourceHash": "14093b9154b53561ad795d1ad3131131ff9d485a2c7c581d57d176f836defcd8",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_30db12660074060ea5c5a467_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The name field will be focused first. By default, a label will be created instead but it can be toggled to a relation by typing __TRILIUM_PH_0__~__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or pressing the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ icon (similarly, typing __TRILIUM_PH_3__ will switch back to a label instead of a relation).",
      "sourceHash": "30db12660074060ea5c5a467c082ef9a228d94d9064e9d81a278c5b0c9767b51",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b244d48951e159f83f5ee9a6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Once the name is filled, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to continue to the value. Type in a value if desired and then press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_3__ again to create the attribute.",
      "sourceHash": "b244d48951e159f83f5ee9a6609784bc14350c0d3ba695678d2a72f606c91fdd",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_78a20eb1df1ed269a6c06af5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking outside the editor will also create the attribute, but only if a name is specified.",
      "sourceHash": "78a20eb1df1ed269a6c06af582ddcb439bc4468fa88d1527127705f13681707f",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Owned attributes",
      "contextHash": "a4440a5e2c2ea3b656c5d6cd7c3ed62b2c8530d671d579ceccda07875d6d302a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a955575c07483916b94a4c14_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Inherited attributes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "a955575c07483916b94a4c14b6f3310113fe18f684c35332e472387b6feb94e3",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Inherited attributes",
      "contextHash": "c3b2fc348d36c6232e9ef105bb1dfaed613232f9fdab938905f903c220248cdd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c47a514c29af5d89a815d7bd_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Inherited labels or relations are shown in the same fashion as the owned ones.",
      "sourceHash": "c47a514c29af5d89a815d7bd5fa6b9d67b2922aa9a0bccb7a4c4ca59fd29a9e9",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Inherited attributes",
      "contextHash": "c3b2fc348d36c6232e9ef105bb1dfaed613232f9fdab938905f903c220248cdd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a8ba20aeb3481ddd331bd6b0_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The only differences are:",
      "sourceHash": "a8ba20aeb3481ddd331bd6b0dc7d4ae8632e0a43075f8a6d3e4279cdec0a3979",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Inherited attributes",
      "contextHash": "c3b2fc348d36c6232e9ef105bb1dfaed613232f9fdab938905f903c220248cdd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f3e35b62e2286f4724d86176_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To the right of the inherited attribute there is a link to the note where the attribute comes from, as well as an __TRILIUM_PH_0__ icon to indicate that it's inheritable.",
      "sourceHash": "f3e35b62e2286f4724d86176ef4e7ece65c510a158c82122f747332f1c76e1fc",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Inherited attributes",
      "contextHash": "c3b2fc348d36c6232e9ef105bb1dfaed613232f9fdab938905f903c220248cdd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e10102f52ad8905426acf987_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking on an inherited attribute will reveal the same popup as owned attributes, but it is not editable. To edit it, first navigate to the note where the attribute is defined.",
      "sourceHash": "e10102f52ad8905426acf9870b8b69ed5935db96759337d2d7668f4d94f6774a",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Inherited attributes",
      "contextHash": "c3b2fc348d36c6232e9ef105bb1dfaed613232f9fdab938905f903c220248cdd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d4bbf575e0b13f9b8316059e_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Definitions__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "d4bbf575e0b13f9b8316059ebcfedf6fac259898f1904682b654dad2485e4cc6",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Definitions",
      "contextHash": "67c6de3e1e6d7e48beefe3de84059e6be8d571c4ca6cd6a1fececcee3b8234ef",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_60bc4d4da8f464e49631b9c2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For attribute definition (see __TRILIUM_PH_0__Promoted Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_1__):",
      "sourceHash": "60bc4d4da8f464e49631b9c23e3121600b19d0854fa2ad7fa80dda669b484767",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Definitions",
      "contextHash": "67c6de3e1e6d7e48beefe3de84059e6be8d571c4ca6cd6a1fececcee3b8234ef",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_aa346be64076cc036e9454d2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The icon indicates the type of the attribute (text, number).",
      "sourceHash": "aa346be64076cc036e9454d22f357d6e4336d58c846dd60dc7cc2dfe16da7887",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Definitions",
      "contextHash": "67c6de3e1e6d7e48beefe3de84059e6be8d571c4ca6cd6a1fececcee3b8234ef",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a26f43174f235026c84e6fff_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If an attribute is promoted, it has a small __TRILIUM_PH_0__ chevron icon overlaid on top of it.",
      "sourceHash": "a26f43174f235026c84e6fffc1485e9c05bc5e34f9c3f3a636e05bf16d903499",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Definitions",
      "contextHash": "67c6de3e1e6d7e48beefe3de84059e6be8d571c4ca6cd6a1fececcee3b8234ef",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_03c96f07a6883c8215046908_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The name indicates the name of the attribute it defines (without the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ or __TRILIUM_PH_1__ prefix).",
      "sourceHash": "03c96f07a6883c8215046908a6a614c9a9f8eacee01ac6ca608536bf11b671f3",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Definitions",
      "contextHash": "67c6de3e1e6d7e48beefe3de84059e6be8d571c4ca6cd6a1fececcee3b8234ef",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6c674e3a13aace8aaf165c5d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To the right of the name a short summary is displayed which indicates the display name (alias), whether it has multiple values or an inverse relation.",
      "sourceHash": "6c674e3a13aace8aaf165c5dd7e0756a2af67db9327a1fae63cb7674d7479334",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Definitions",
      "contextHash": "67c6de3e1e6d7e48beefe3de84059e6be8d571c4ca6cd6a1fececcee3b8234ef",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_56535a7e1127a246c56fd033_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking on a definition reveals a popup, where the name, type, display name and other aspects can be configured.",
      "sourceHash": "56535a7e1127a246c56fd033be80b594a025d6c716fbea5a11e126070c549485",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Definitions",
      "contextHash": "67c6de3e1e6d7e48beefe3de84059e6be8d571c4ca6cd6a1fececcee3b8234ef",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cda19cb7e3f2b6228ef915ad_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To add a label definition, click the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Add definition__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__) item at the end of the list; its type can be changed to a relation from the popup. Both kinds of definitions can also be added from the __TRILIUM_PH_3__ button in the __TRILIUM_PH_4__toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "cda19cb7e3f2b6228ef915adf3d3c7b09b1ad6273a636fdf44e954d83ac4f657",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Definitions",
      "contextHash": "67c6de3e1e6d7e48beefe3de84059e6be8d571c4ca6cd6a1fececcee3b8234ef",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c6312a87cf56747389af34a4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For inherited definition, there is a link to the note where the definition comes from, as well as an __TRILIUM_PH_0__ icon to indicate that it's inherited.",
      "sourceHash": "c6312a87cf56747389af34a49b7c296a8c22c0a0012b0bf3bf69517ce91d6123",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Definitions",
      "contextHash": "67c6de3e1e6d7e48beefe3de84059e6be8d571c4ca6cd6a1fececcee3b8234ef",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d1151018b2bf9a4211c0cfb9_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Selecting attributes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "d1151018b2bf9a4211c0cfb9ca5003b9c453c57b9b013f44150404ccfa15f0fa",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Selecting attributes",
      "contextHash": "a987180b7e35a7e6afbbe35af7f70cd4c448aaaf7620100ae70e41f5ef2b7e18",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_45a6075ee51c6e180151379c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Multiple attributes can be selected in order to copy or delete them together:",
      "sourceHash": "45a6075ee51c6e180151379c27507a538ca90623087f0cf98b82c6bc465f7854",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Selecting attributes",
      "contextHash": "a987180b7e35a7e6afbbe35af7f70cd4c448aaaf7620100ae70e41f5ef2b7e18",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b5cd034362d4b0cb04ccbe78_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Hovering over an attribute shows a checkbox in place of its icon. Click it to select the attribute.",
      "sourceHash": "b5cd034362d4b0cb04ccbe788dfacc7a7bd697c84e552629c67f9d15b93feb2d",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Selecting attributes",
      "contextHash": "a987180b7e35a7e6afbbe35af7f70cd4c448aaaf7620100ae70e41f5ef2b7e18",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_33a397f4e059c9780a7cbf1c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Alternatively, hold __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__Cmd__TRILIUM_PH_3__ on macOS) while clicking an attribute to select it, or __TRILIUM_PH_4__Shift__TRILIUM_PH_5__ to select a range of attributes. A range can span multiple sections.",
      "sourceHash": "33a397f4e059c9780a7cbf1cf5a282a346b3db6758fe2c98c016c237881d0841",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Selecting attributes",
      "contextHash": "a987180b7e35a7e6afbbe35af7f70cd4c448aaaf7620100ae70e41f5ef2b7e18",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d64bedd9d37d904efd092024_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Once at least one attribute is selected, every attribute shows its checkbox, and clicking anywhere on an attribute selects or deselects it instead of opening the detail popup.",
      "sourceHash": "d64bedd9d37d904efd0920244938ac6d224a747aa7d2625a304476443429ccd9",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Selecting attributes",
      "contextHash": "a987180b7e35a7e6afbbe35af7f70cd4c448aaaf7620100ae70e41f5ef2b7e18",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_03aca4fc19c48d7356773912_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Select all__TRILIUM_PH_1__ checkbox in the toolbar selects every attribute; while attributes are selected, it shows how many. Clicking it again clears the selection, as does pressing __TRILIUM_PH_2__Esc__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "03aca4fc19c48d73567739125ae4c81d7e59a8d8b679b54da93db8f4aa9ae83b",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Selecting attributes",
      "contextHash": "a987180b7e35a7e6afbbe35af7f70cd4c448aaaf7620100ae70e41f5ef2b7e18",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_dd2b02431f88655d38603608_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "While attributes are selected, the toolbar shows:",
      "sourceHash": "dd2b02431f88655d386036083c0ea217146e93dab1eba6a59af1386d2f7850c4",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Selecting attributes",
      "contextHash": "a987180b7e35a7e6afbbe35af7f70cd4c448aaaf7620100ae70e41f5ef2b7e18",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4a26028fef0471718efebc57_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button, which copies the selected attributes.",
      "sourceHash": "4a26028fef0471718efebc5766ef1dee5d0292284beceef5cdf4ce1f1ed51913",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Selecting attributes",
      "contextHash": "a987180b7e35a7e6afbbe35af7f70cd4c448aaaf7620100ae70e41f5ef2b7e18",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_21f15ae778b44dfca74cb711_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button, which deletes the selected attributes after a confirmation. It only appears if all the selected attributes belong to the current note, since inherited attributes can only be deleted from the note they come from.",
      "sourceHash": "21f15ae778b44dfca74cb71179f88b24f3160950bff8b5228ad4f778600f03df",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Selecting attributes",
      "contextHash": "a987180b7e35a7e6afbbe35af7f70cd4c448aaaf7620100ae70e41f5ef2b7e18",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_895f48f02902292ecd399a53_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Right-clicking an attribute shows a menu with the same actions, as well as pasting. If the attribute is not part of the selection, the menu applies only to that attribute.",
      "sourceHash": "895f48f02902292ecd399a539c982c4b131846c0a0be87162bdcab0636f43fa6",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Selecting attributes",
      "contextHash": "a987180b7e35a7e6afbbe35af7f70cd4c448aaaf7620100ae70e41f5ef2b7e18",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a0465c723e4d49849fd664c8_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Copying and pasting attributes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "a0465c723e4d49849fd664c872c5fb39d407cecb74e40df46b7d937a49f60fae",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Copying and pasting attributes",
      "contextHash": "530f1a9f77f814b4fbb16db4623cad0fb37fb4676beb1257061623fecff4739d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_96196f35f7a3125eb511075f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Attributes can be copied from one note and pasted into another:",
      "sourceHash": "96196f35f7a3125eb511075fa7d42498ef0a58eb5bef279c93b5a27078e23719",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Copying and pasting attributes",
      "contextHash": "530f1a9f77f814b4fbb16db4623cad0fb37fb4676beb1257061623fecff4739d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c1b1b9fd2caabbcc7f6052ce_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To copy, select the attributes and press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__C__TRILIUM_PH_3__, or use the __TRILIUM_PH_4__ button in the toolbar or the context menu.",
      "sourceHash": "c1b1b9fd2caabbcc7f6052ce3f2a86fb47a424ed6910e3d7a24893d5a4bc3c2e",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Copying and pasting attributes",
      "contextHash": "530f1a9f77f814b4fbb16db4623cad0fb37fb4676beb1257061623fecff4739d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_93abf7f5c7f99f2ed98c8d75_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To paste, navigate to the destination note and press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__V__TRILIUM_PH_3__ after clicking anywhere in the attributes tab, or use the __TRILIUM_PH_4__ button in the toolbar. Right-clicking an attribute or an empty area of a section also offers to paste.",
      "sourceHash": "93abf7f5c7f99f2ed98c8d75e21c3222028099894880c29b4e0c78a2b7801800",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Copying and pasting attributes",
      "contextHash": "530f1a9f77f814b4fbb16db4623cad0fb37fb4676beb1257061623fecff4739d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c7b1441b62ea3d97cab5ad1d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Attributes are copied as text, in the same format as the attributes editor (for example __TRILIUM_PH_0__). As a result:",
      "sourceHash": "c7b1441b62ea3d97cab5ad1db6452ba12106ace2f81b29eaae82ca58991ede56",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Copying and pasting attributes",
      "contextHash": "530f1a9f77f814b4fbb16db4623cad0fb37fb4676beb1257061623fecff4739d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_50797e84f4fbc0bfd1e152c5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Copied attributes can be pasted into the attributes editor or into a note, and the text of the attributes editor can be pasted into the attributes tab.",
      "sourceHash": "50797e84f4fbc0bfd1e152c53d7b7c97b39049765ae90dd33865f6abb16b957f",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Copying and pasting attributes",
      "contextHash": "530f1a9f77f814b4fbb16db4623cad0fb37fb4676beb1257061623fecff4739d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_26836f9bd1e3ee8508fc9889_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Attributes can be written by hand in any other application and then pasted into Trilium.",
      "sourceHash": "26836f9bd1e3ee8508fc9889bc8cf3fd14072799220b59e0e9eb5ec3fc0665c9",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Copying and pasting attributes",
      "contextHash": "530f1a9f77f814b4fbb16db4623cad0fb37fb4676beb1257061623fecff4739d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a1ccd0d892bc663cf50183bd_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When pasting, the attributes become owned attributes of the current note, even if they were inherited in the source note:",
      "sourceHash": "a1ccd0d892bc663cf50183bd6807b5358751c0456d99fca0d3f7543e798b9503",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Copying and pasting attributes",
      "contextHash": "530f1a9f77f814b4fbb16db4623cad0fb37fb4676beb1257061623fecff4739d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_28baf88b1f6d521ee3595fea_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If the note already has an attribute with the same name, its value is replaced by the pasted one.",
      "sourceHash": "28baf88b1f6d521ee3595fea2eaea7f26b4ceefa70e2aafb01bc52872927a265",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Copying and pasting attributes",
      "contextHash": "530f1a9f77f814b4fbb16db4623cad0fb37fb4676beb1257061623fecff4739d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_926087eab3c65e6f7c471405_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If a definition marks the attribute as having multiple values (see __TRILIUM_PH_0__Promoted Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_1__), the pasted value is added alongside the existing ones instead, unless the same value is already present.",
      "sourceHash": "926087eab3c65e6f7c471405e06a9623dc337a91cb509b528bb4606c8e056371",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Copying and pasting attributes",
      "contextHash": "530f1a9f77f814b4fbb16db4623cad0fb37fb4676beb1257061623fecff4739d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f15e5f76a9e44fff7d11e4b9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__V__TRILIUM_PH_3__ pastes what the system clipboard holds, whereas the __TRILIUM_PH_4__ button and the context menu paste the attributes last copied in Trilium. The two differ if something else was copied in the meantime.",
      "sourceHash": "f15e5f76a9e44fff7d11e4b9286b6f774a2fa43b9c37f4451333efaee3bca078",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Copying and pasting attributes",
      "contextHash": "530f1a9f77f814b4fbb16db4623cad0fb37fb4676beb1257061623fecff4739d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_155cfb2d8cfd2b36b9358101_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Mobile__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "155cfb2d8cfd2b36b9358101cae0289da8ea2554478710a3c0ec365d0d548d3b",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Mobile",
      "contextHash": "dbddd42767cf2231919bebbfee10e293ab9b2d0e92cefbd874ae86c8590e07d6",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_889e0f45c51118ea41f1417d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On mobile, the attributes are the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ tab of the note panel (see __TRILIUM_PH_2__Right Sidebar__TRILIUM_PH_3__), which opens as a sheet at the bottom of the screen from the __TRILIUM_PH_4__ button beside the __TRILIUM_PH_5__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_6__. Selecting __TRILIUM_PH_7__Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_8__ in the note menu, below __TRILIUM_PH_9__Backlinks__TRILIUM_PH_10__ and __TRILIUM_PH_11__Note paths__TRILIUM_PH_12__, opens the panel on that tab. Tapping an attribute opens it on a page of its own, with a __TRILIUM_PH_13__ button to return to the list.",
      "sourceHash": "889e0f45c51118ea41f1417d63d3fcd4fde6a03ab057c9327f2f9c9603c2b927",
      "context": "Attributes tab > Mobile",
