    {
      "id": "u_725dce35c29bc9fd9f396e81_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On mobile, the __TRILIUM_PH_0__toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_1__ takes the place of the tab's name in the header of the sheet, and each section is displayed as a separate card:",
